# Explore safety — live SUT

Exploring a running web SUT is a real side-effecting session.

## Must

- Prefer create-on-throwaway-data over mutating shared fixtures.
- Stop and ask before DELETE / archive / permission-admin / billing actions.
- Persist only **sanitized** evidence (`artifacts/evidence/<run_id>/`).
- Cite `run_id` from any `assets/explore` or `assets/design` write.

## Must not

- Persist Authorization / Cookie / Set-Cookie / tokens / passwords.
- Treat captcha/SSO/OTP bypass as something the agent should solve.
- Crawl the entire product in one session — stay on the agreed vertical slice.
